menu "AURA updates"

    config AURA_OTA_PUBLIC_KEY
        string "The owner's update public key (P-256, 130 hex characters)"
        default ""
        help
            The public half of the owner's update signing key, as
            `node scripts/update-signing.mjs keygen <private key file>` prints it
            (04, then X and Y). An update installs only if its manifest carries
            the owner's signature for this key; with no key, nothing installs.
            The private key never enters the repository.

endmenu
